+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: every route.
+
+A request without a key or with an unknown key answers 401 `unauthorized`
+(before routing, so even unknown routes); a known key calling a route its
+role does not allow answers 403 `forbidden`.
+
+## Audit
+
+Every non-`GET` request made with a known key, whatever its outcome
+(including 403s and failed checks), adds an entry to `audit`:
+`{ "id", "at", "keyName", "method", "path", "status" }`. `path` is without the
+query string; keys themselves are never stored there. `GET /audit` lists the
+entries newest first and is for managers only.

